          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-lucide="paw-print" aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-paw-print w-6 h-6 text-[#CE7048]"><circle cx="11" cy="4" r="2"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="8" r="2"></circle><circle cx="20" cy="16" r="2"></circle><path d="M9 10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v3.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-6.84 1.045Q6.52 17.48 4.46 16.84A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5.5 10Z"></path></svg> –î–∞–≤–∞–π –∑–Ω–∞–∫–æ–º–∏—Ç—å—Å—è!
